{"candidateAnswer":"hit the studio and start writing new lyrics","evidence":"[D5:11 | 1:16 pm on 3 May, 2023] Dave: If I'm having trouble coming up with ideas, I usually immerse myself in something I love, like concerts or my favorite albums. Doing that usually helps to jumpstart my inspiration. Maybe try taking a break from music and explore other things. Plus, have some fun while you're at it!","itemId":"urn:uuid:530fa4dc-77af-50f0-95d7-69c26c613f5f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1702c88adbd20633bf0b278c2998fc52d9aa894816117147122e29e2ad281c10","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How does Calvin plan to jumpstart his inspiration?","referenceAnswer":"explore other things and have some fun","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1702c88adbd20633bf0b278c2998fc52d9aa894816117147122e29e2ad281c10"}}]}